{"chunk_id": "API-001-chunk-000", "document_id": "API-001", "text": "# API Authentication\n## Bearer tokens\nFlowDesk API requests require a Bearer token in the Authorization header.\n\nExample:\nAuthorization: Bearer <API_TOKEN>\n\nTokens should be treated as secrets and must not be exposed in client-side code.", "metadata": {"product": "FlowDesk", "version": "3.2", "access_level": "public", "document_id": "API-001", "source_name": "Bearer Token Authentication", "section_heading": "Bearer Token Authentication", "last_updated": "2026-07-15", "document_type": "api", "source_path": "docs\\api\\authentication.md", "file_name": "authentication.md", "chunk_index": 0, "chunking_strategy": "fixed_overlap", "chunk_start_char": 0, "chunk_end_char": 237, "text_hash": "22d832b8dc6d8f5c1710d6c6729ee28b10fd258d127a2674dfa38229acea36c9"}}
{"chunk_id": "API-008-chunk-000", "document_id": "API-008", "text": "# API Errors\nCommon HTTP statuses include 400 for invalid requests, 401 for authentication failures, 403 for authorization failures, 404 for missing resources, and 429 for rate limiting.", "metadata": {"product": "FlowDesk", "version": "3.2", "access_level": "public", "document_id": "API-008", "source_name": "Error Responses", "section_heading": "Error Responses", "last_updated": "2026-07-16", "document_type": "api", "source_path": "docs\\api\\errors.md", "file_name": "errors.md", "chunk_index": 0, "chunking_strategy": "fixed_overlap", "chunk_start_char": 0, "chunk_end_char": 186, "text_hash": "a79279b4f0d289e268c6a1c7b4da2f4d97013123a5bacf8f6f1b1481f26449fa"}}
{"chunk_id": "API-009-chunk-000", "document_id": "API-009", "text": "# Idempotency\nSupported write operations accept an idempotency key so clients can safely retry a request without unintentionally creating duplicate operations.", "metadata": {"product": "FlowDesk", "version": "3.2", "access_level": "public", "document_id": "API-009", "source_name": "Idempotency", "section_heading": "Idempotency", "last_updated": "2026-07-04", "document_type": "api", "source_path": "docs\\api\\idempotency.md", "file_name": "idempotency.md", "chunk_index": 0, "chunking_strategy": "fixed_overlap", "chunk_start_char": 0, "chunk_end_char": 159, "text_hash": "b615e3a2753564ebeda668d40a6d49920f666d1b4a38f36ec46a0822f4df84b0"}}
{"chunk_id": "API-007-chunk-000", "document_id": "API-007", "text": "# Pagination\nList endpoints return paginated results. Clients should follow the pagination cursor returned by the API rather than assuming a fixed page size.", "metadata": {"product": "FlowDesk", "version": "3.2", "access_level": "public", "document_id": "API-007", "source_name": "Pagination", "section_heading": "Pagination", "last_updated": "2026-07-09", "document_type": "api", "source_path": "docs\\api\\pagination.md", "file_name": "pagination.md", "chunk_index": 0, "chunking_strategy": "fixed_overlap", "chunk_start_char": 0, "chunk_end_char": 157, "text_hash": "d14dc9961ebdf8e7ca0fb1c77c607b80d3f64c957b5b61f272a4982ca7c238ff"}}
{"chunk_id": "API-006-chunk-000", "document_id": "API-006", "text": "# API Rate Limits\nRequests are subject to endpoint and workspace rate limits. When a limit is exceeded, the service returns HTTP 429. Clients should honor Retry-After when provided.", "metadata": {"product": "FlowDesk", "version": "3.2", "access_level": "public", "document_id": "API-006", "source_name": "Rate Limits", "section_heading": "Rate Limits", "last_updated": "2026-07-17", "document_type": "api", "source_path": "docs\\api\\rate-limits.md", "file_name": "rate-limits.md", "chunk_index": 0, "chunking_strategy": "fixed_overlap", "chunk_start_char": 0, "chunk_end_char": 181, "text_hash": "8036810ddf8a00773eb9ca6f5247dacf189b3e899fb47be10eba678a04ce381d"}}
{"chunk_id": "API-002-chunk-000", "document_id": "API-002", "text": "# Scoped API Tokens\nAPI tokens can be issued with scopes that limit the operations they can perform. A valid token without the required scope can still receive HTTP 403.", "metadata": {"product": "FlowDesk", "version": "3.2", "access_level": "public", "document_id": "API-002", "source_name": "Scoped Tokens", "section_heading": "Scoped Tokens", "last_updated": "2026-07-15", "document_type": "api", "source_path": "docs\\api\\scoped-tokens.md", "file_name": "scoped-tokens.md", "chunk_index": 0, "chunking_strategy": "fixed_overlap", "chunk_start_char": 0, "chunk_end_char": 169, "text_hash": "b962c56b114a790350e92cc2d40dddb2cf3b34700b365647aeff7692e99e1e26"}}
{"chunk_id": "API-003-chunk-000", "document_id": "API-003", "text": "# Tickets API\nThe Tickets API supports creating, retrieving, updating, and listing tickets. Ticket IDs can be used to retrieve individual records.", "metadata": {"product": "FlowDesk", "version": "3.2", "access_level": "public", "document_id": "API-003", "source_name": "Tickets API", "section_heading": "Tickets API", "last_updated": "2026-07-10", "document_type": "api", "source_path": "docs\\api\\tickets.md", "file_name": "tickets.md", "chunk_index": 0, "chunking_strategy": "fixed_overlap", "chunk_start_char": 0, "chunk_end_char": 146, "text_hash": "cd202bc9053ef09e6a61298aff930c7f39b83db09494da5e49b65029a8463d56"}}
{"chunk_id": "API-004-chunk-000", "document_id": "API-004", "text": "# Users API\nThe Users API exposes user records subject to workspace permissions and token scopes. Administrative operations require elevated permissions.", "metadata": {"product": "FlowDesk", "version": "3.2", "access_level": "public", "document_id": "API-004", "source_name": "Users API", "section_heading": "Users API", "last_updated": "2026-07-10", "document_type": "api", "source_path": "docs\\api\\users.md", "file_name": "users.md", "chunk_index": 0, "chunking_strategy": "fixed_overlap", "chunk_start_char": 0, "chunk_end_char": 153, "text_hash": "4932934d5421efc8100b542eafe396235c409fc38a1f99dbb10ccfa7ff45cdcf"}}
{"chunk_id": "API-010-chunk-000", "document_id": "API-010", "text": "# API Versioning\nThe current API documentation describes version 3.2. Clients should check release notes before relying on behavior from an older API version.", "metadata": {"product": "FlowDesk", "version": "3.2", "access_level": "public", "document_id": "API-010", "source_name": "API Versioning", "section_heading": "API Versioning", "last_updated": "2026-07-15", "document_type": "api", "source_path": "docs\\api\\versioning.md", "file_name": "versioning.md", "chunk_index": 0, "chunking_strategy": "fixed_overlap", "chunk_start_char": 0, "chunk_end_char": 158, "text_hash": "edb27e161c73a409452bc2ff95dd21357d0c8d26fb528a9133028dff7d378f71"}}
{"chunk_id": "API-005-chunk-000", "document_id": "API-005", "text": "# Webhooks API\nWebhook subscriptions specify an HTTPS endpoint and one or more event types. Failed deliveries may be retried according to the delivery policy.", "metadata": {"product": "FlowDesk", "version": "3.2", "access_level": "public", "document_id": "API-005", "source_name": "Webhooks API", "section_heading": "Webhooks API", "last_updated": "2026-07-12", "document_type": "api", "source_path": "docs\\api\\webhooks.md", "file_name": "webhooks.md", "chunk_index": 0, "chunking_strategy": "fixed_overlap", "chunk_start_char": 0, "chunk_end_char": 158, "text_hash": "96e0424bacb2551d63b1cf788ed28f36d002526d26f433febecf93eddc18605c"}}
{"chunk_id": "FAQ-001-chunk-000", "document_id": "FAQ-001", "text": "# Account Basics\n## What is FlowDesk?\nFlowDesk is a customer-support workflow platform used to manage tickets, teams, automations, and customer conversations.\n\n## Can one account have multiple workspaces?\nYes. An organization can create multiple workspaces and assign users to the workspaces they need.", "metadata": {"product": "FlowDesk", "version": "3.2", "access_level": "public", "document_id": "FAQ-001", "source_name": "Account Basics", "section_heading": "Account Basics", "last_updated": "2026-07-10", "document_type": "faq", "source_path": "docs\\faq\\account-basics.md", "file_name": "account-basics.md", "chunk_index": 0, "chunking_strategy": "fixed_overlap", "chunk_start_char": 0, "chunk_end_char": 302, "text_hash": "76af51cbf50d77401a342e4bb4fe50d813d15a776a626bac69924b53137eb322"}}
{"chunk_id": "FAQ-008-chunk-000", "document_id": "FAQ-008", "text": "# API Limits FAQ\n## Is there an API rate limit?\nYes. FlowDesk applies rate limits to API requests.\n\n## What happens when the limit is exceeded?\nThe API returns HTTP 429 and clients should retry after the documented delay.", "metadata": {"product": "FlowDesk", "version": "3.2", "access_level": "public", "document_id": "FAQ-008", "source_name": "API Limits", "section_heading": "API Limits", "last_updated": "2026-07-15", "document_type": "faq", "source_path": "docs\\faq\\api-limits.md", "file_name": "api-limits.md", "chunk_index": 0, "chunking_strategy": "fixed_overlap", "chunk_start_char": 0, "chunk_end_char": 221, "text_hash": "eeab433063bc005a477c224c256e0602eaa4669e56eda6ccf53ab78ea42e9ae0"}}
{"chunk_id": "FAQ-002-chunk-000", "document_id": "FAQ-002", "text": "# Billing FAQ\n## When does billing occur?\nPaid subscriptions are billed at the beginning of each billing period.\n\n## Can billing administrators download invoices?\nYes. Users with billing administration permissions can download invoices from Workspace Settings > Billing.", "metadata": {"product": "FlowDesk", "version": "3.2", "access_level": "public", "document_id": "FAQ-002", "source_name": "Billing", "section_heading": "Billing", "last_updated": "2026-07-12", "document_type": "faq", "source_path": "docs\\faq\\billing.md", "file_name": "billing.md", "chunk_index": 0, "chunking_strategy": "fixed_overlap", "chunk_start_char": 0, "chunk_end_char": 270, "text_hash": "686c1cde79d3cbd7aa98562d071322a773428524c834cea2bd84567a0217bde2"}}
{"chunk_id": "FAQ-007-chunk-000", "document_id": "FAQ-007", "text": "# Data Export FAQ\n## Can ticket data be exported?\nAuthorized users can export supported ticket fields from the workspace export tools.\n\n## Is every field included?\nNo. Exportable fields depend on the object type and the user's permissions.", "metadata": {"product": "FlowDesk", "version": "3.2", "access_level": "public", "document_id": "FAQ-007", "source_name": "Data Export", "section_heading": "Data Export", "last_updated": "2026-07-13", "document_type": "faq", "source_path": "docs\\faq\\data-export.md", "file_name": "data-export.md", "chunk_index": 0, "chunking_strategy": "fixed_overlap", "chunk_start_char": 0, "chunk_end_char": 239, "text_hash": "352d7f66bdd768560077487d5422dec5929055f3414b96f96714ed06d0171e94"}}
{"chunk_id": "FAQ-005-chunk-000", "document_id": "FAQ-005", "text": "# Notifications FAQ\n## Can users disable email notifications?\nUsers can control supported notification categories from their personal notification settings.\n\n## Are security alerts optional?\nSecurity-related alerts cannot be disabled.", "metadata": {"product": "FlowDesk", "version": "3.2", "access_level": "public", "document_id": "FAQ-005", "source_name": "Notifications", "section_heading": "Notifications", "last_updated": "2026-07-11", "document_type": "faq", "source_path": "docs\\faq\\notifications.md", "file_name": "notifications.md", "chunk_index": 0, "chunking_strategy": "fixed_overlap", "chunk_start_char": 0, "chunk_end_char": 234, "text_hash": "b2401759e7be563ca8e5531e821813683e9f014c52ed5b2eb6ae72fc86e711d3"}}
{"chunk_id": "FAQ-003-chunk-000", "document_id": "FAQ-003", "text": "# Roles and Permissions\n## What roles are available?\nFlowDesk provides Owner, Admin, Agent, and Viewer roles.\n\n## Can an Agent change workspace settings?\nNo. Workspace settings require Admin or Owner permissions.", "metadata": {"product": "FlowDesk", "version": "3.2", "access_level": "public", "document_id": "FAQ-003", "source_name": "Roles and Permissions", "section_heading": "Roles and Permissions", "last_updated": "2026-07-14", "document_type": "faq", "source_path": "docs\\faq\\roles.md", "file_name": "roles.md", "chunk_index": 0, "chunking_strategy": "fixed_overlap", "chunk_start_char": 0, "chunk_end_char": 212, "text_hash": "087a97cad0d71c671c74bd170e279c1bcbffe7ee2d90bfe38b4b1546cd015eb0"}}
{"chunk_id": "FAQ-004-chunk-000", "document_id": "FAQ-004", "text": "# Search FAQ\n## Can I search tickets by ID?\nYes. Enter the ticket ID in the global search field.\n\n## Does search support exact phrases?\nPutting a phrase in quotation marks prioritizes exact phrase matches.", "metadata": {"product": "FlowDesk", "version": "3.2", "access_level": "public", "document_id": "FAQ-004", "source_name": "Search", "section_heading": "Search", "last_updated": "2026-07-08", "document_type": "faq", "source_path": "docs\\faq\\search.md", "file_name": "search.md", "chunk_index": 0, "chunking_strategy": "fixed_overlap", "chunk_start_char": 0, "chunk_end_char": 205, "text_hash": "a5bec10500c86b06dd69d096c51b2c0150afcc1906935f4afecc2a1e346c8f27"}}
{"chunk_id": "FAQ-006-chunk-000", "document_id": "FAQ-006", "text": "# Webhooks FAQ\n## What are webhooks?\nWebhooks allow FlowDesk to send event notifications to an external HTTP endpoint.\n\n## How quickly are webhook events delivered?\nEvents are normally delivered within seconds, but delivery timing is not guaranteed.", "metadata": {"product": "FlowDesk", "version": "3.2", "access_level": "public", "document_id": "FAQ-006", "source_name": "Webhooks", "section_heading": "Webhooks", "last_updated": "2026-07-09", "document_type": "faq", "source_path": "docs\\faq\\webhooks.md", "file_name": "webhooks.md", "chunk_index": 0, "chunking_strategy": "fixed_overlap", "chunk_start_char": 0, "chunk_end_char": 249, "text_hash": "13d3959e2d530d3cbe794f66abe9b23d740f3c5a864d2c7ac56fb5cbf0db4719"}}
{"chunk_id": "ONB-002-chunk-000", "document_id": "ONB-002", "text": "# Add Users\nAdmins and Owners can invite users by email. Select a role during invitation. Invitations that expire must be resent.", "metadata": {"product": "FlowDesk", "version": "3.2", "access_level": "public", "document_id": "ONB-002", "source_name": "Add Users", "section_heading": "Add Users", "last_updated": "2026-07-02", "document_type": "onboarding", "source_path": "docs\\onboarding\\add-users.md", "file_name": "add-users.md", "chunk_index": 0, "chunking_strategy": "fixed_overlap", "chunk_start_char": 0, "chunk_end_char": 129, "text_hash": "ec0ea02c009ebcac25ad329feed484c75571b35569dc3a7f6d6b66ef584ed200"}}
{"chunk_id": "ONB-004-chunk-000", "document_id": "ONB-004", "text": "# First API Request\nCreate an API token with the required scope, include it as a Bearer token in the Authorization header, and call an endpoint available to that token.", "metadata": {"product": "FlowDesk", "version": "3.2", "access_level": "public", "document_id": "ONB-004", "source_name": "First API Request", "section_heading": "First API Request", "last_updated": "2026-07-05", "document_type": "onboarding", "source_path": "docs\\onboarding\\api-first-request.md", "file_name": "api-first-request.md", "chunk_index": 0, "chunking_strategy": "fixed_overlap", "chunk_start_char": 0, "chunk_end_char": 168, "text_hash": "4e9935b87640d47095c31e315815283a6b26b08fc3bc51e2ec7cbde844282aae"}}
{"chunk_id": "ONB-001-chunk-000", "document_id": "ONB-001", "text": "# Create a Workspace\nAn organization can create a workspace from the organization administration area. The creator becomes the initial Owner unless the organization uses a managed provisioning workflow.", "metadata": {"product": "FlowDesk", "version": "3.2", "access_level": "public", "document_id": "ONB-001", "source_name": "Create a Workspace", "section_heading": "Create a Workspace", "last_updated": "2026-07-01", "document_type": "onboarding", "source_path": "docs\\onboarding\\create-workspace.md", "file_name": "create-workspace.md", "chunk_index": 0, "chunking_strategy": "fixed_overlap", "chunk_start_char": 0, "chunk_end_char": 202, "text_hash": "af3035aa1c8d7d29754451fffd8fd2f15d15b2202e7f0bcea208b0c713664020"}}
{"chunk_id": "ONB-006-chunk-000", "document_id": "ONB-006", "text": "# Security Basics\nUse individual accounts, least-privilege roles, strong authentication, and secure handling of API tokens. Do not share credentials between users.", "metadata": {"product": "FlowDesk", "version": "3.2", "access_level": "public", "document_id": "ONB-006", "source_name": "Security Basics", "section_heading": "Security Basics", "last_updated": "2026-07-03", "document_type": "onboarding", "source_path": "docs\\onboarding\\security-basics.md", "file_name": "security-basics.md", "chunk_index": 0, "chunking_strategy": "fixed_overlap", "chunk_start_char": 0, "chunk_end_char": 163, "text_hash": "42d09fbeebdd0c9e1593c9f7e62c20f47463fadf67f00b600180bb8ead273ef2"}}
{"chunk_id": "ONB-003-chunk-000", "document_id": "ONB-003", "text": "# Set Up SSO\nOrganizations can configure SSO from Security Settings. Configuration requires identity-provider metadata and administrative privileges.", "metadata": {"product": "FlowDesk", "version": "3.2", "access_level": "public", "document_id": "ONB-003", "source_name": "Set Up SSO", "section_heading": "Set Up SSO", "last_updated": "2026-06-28", "document_type": "onboarding", "source_path": "docs\\onboarding\\setup-sso.md", "file_name": "setup-sso.md", "chunk_index": 0, "chunking_strategy": "fixed_overlap", "chunk_start_char": 0, "chunk_end_char": 149, "text_hash": "1d07d7db75d7cf226ae7aff22c24b0f886161df313018f878e6825dc7ee184c7"}}
{"chunk_id": "ONB-005-chunk-000", "document_id": "ONB-005", "text": "# Set Up a Webhook\nCreate a webhook subscription, provide a reachable HTTPS endpoint, select events, and verify delivery using the webhook delivery log.", "metadata": {"product": "FlowDesk", "version": "3.2", "access_level": "public", "document_id": "ONB-005", "source_name": "Set Up a Webhook", "section_heading": "Set Up a Webhook", "last_updated": "2026-07-06", "document_type": "onboarding", "source_path": "docs\\onboarding\\webhook-setup.md", "file_name": "webhook-setup.md", "chunk_index": 0, "chunking_strategy": "fixed_overlap", "chunk_start_char": 0, "chunk_end_char": 152, "text_hash": "99c28686b44f3aeb9f1f5b5b8d8b957298c2098539ce45dd4c110c07eb330a61"}}
{"chunk_id": "POL-003-chunk-000", "document_id": "POL-003", "text": "# Access Control\nAccess should follow least privilege. Owners and Admins can manage workspace settings. Agents should receive only the permissions required for support work.", "metadata": {"product": "FlowDesk", "version": "3.2", "access_level": "public", "document_id": "POL-003", "source_name": "Access Control", "section_heading": "Access Control", "last_updated": "2026-07-02", "document_type": "policies", "source_path": "docs\\policies\\access-control.md", "file_name": "access-control.md", "chunk_index": 0, "chunking_strategy": "fixed_overlap", "chunk_start_char": 0, "chunk_end_char": 173, "text_hash": "fb49e3752c9ea98b2dc6bf537d70483d1c4e68f5846e8cded53535ffee79a7c0"}}
{"chunk_id": "POL-001-chunk-000", "document_id": "POL-001", "text": "# API Token Security\nAPI tokens are credentials and must be protected. Users must not share tokens between people. Tokens should not be committed to source control or embedded in public client-side applications.", "metadata": {"product": "FlowDesk", "version": "3.2", "access_level": "public", "document_id": "POL-001", "source_name": "API Token Security", "section_heading": "API Token Security", "last_updated": "2026-07-01", "document_type": "policies", "source_path": "docs\\policies\\api-token-security.md", "file_name": "api-token-security.md", "chunk_index": 0, "chunking_strategy": "fixed_overlap", "chunk_start_char": 0, "chunk_end_char": 211, "text_hash": "5e0689539316f5e8589efc9cda183d0e0ddf9873484feafea461740ac485cb55"}}
{"chunk_id": "POL-002-chunk-000", "document_id": "POL-002", "text": "# Data Retention\nWorkspace data is retained according to the organization's configured retention policy and applicable service terms. Retention periods may differ by data type and plan.", "metadata": {"product": "FlowDesk", "version": "3.2", "access_level": "public", "document_id": "POL-002", "source_name": "Data Retention", "section_heading": "Data Retention", "last_updated": "2026-06-30", "document_type": "policies", "source_path": "docs\\policies\\data-retention.md", "file_name": "data-retention.md", "chunk_index": 0, "chunking_strategy": "fixed_overlap", "chunk_start_char": 0, "chunk_end_char": 185, "text_hash": "99fa67f9148f554aa73b63f14afccb51d81556f80ef6b944361a3a44b2a61914"}}
{"chunk_id": "POL-006-chunk-000", "document_id": "POL-006", "text": "# Incident Response\nSecurity incidents are investigated by the security team. Internal incident details are restricted to authorized personnel and may not be present in customer-facing documentation.", "metadata": {"product": "FlowDesk", "version": "3.2", "access_level": "internal", "document_id": "POL-006", "source_name": "Incident Response", "section_heading": "Incident Response", "last_updated": "2026-06-10", "document_type": "policies", "source_path": "docs\\policies\\incident-response.md", "file_name": "incident-response.md", "chunk_index": 0, "chunking_strategy": "fixed_overlap", "chunk_start_char": 0, "chunk_end_char": 199, "text_hash": "125356c9ef93a9c6cece55124cca8ddc8af79ccc67d868a8bf9cb7369894aa0f"}}
{"chunk_id": "POL-004-chunk-000", "document_id": "POL-004", "text": "# Security Alerts\nSecurity alerts are mandatory notifications for selected security events and cannot be disabled by individual users.", "metadata": {"product": "FlowDesk", "version": "3.2", "access_level": "public", "document_id": "POL-004", "source_name": "Security Alerts", "section_heading": "Security Alerts", "last_updated": "2026-06-25", "document_type": "policies", "source_path": "docs\\policies\\security-alerts.md", "file_name": "security-alerts.md", "chunk_index": 0, "chunking_strategy": "fixed_overlap", "chunk_start_char": 0, "chunk_end_char": 134, "text_hash": "1176f22d3016e8f8222591fcb170c775bf353e633108d93707238a7f6be5a661"}}
{"chunk_id": "POL-005-chunk-000", "document_id": "POL-005", "text": "# Third-Party Integrations\nExternal integrations should be granted only the permissions they require. Review integration access periodically and revoke unused connections.", "metadata": {"product": "FlowDesk", "version": "3.2", "access_level": "public", "document_id": "POL-005", "source_name": "Third-Party Integrations", "section_heading": "Third-Party Integrations", "last_updated": "2026-05-30", "document_type": "policies", "source_path": "docs\\policies\\third-party.md", "file_name": "third-party.md", "chunk_index": 0, "chunking_strategy": "fixed_overlap", "chunk_start_char": 0, "chunk_end_char": 171, "text_hash": "e14f5bc88a212c32a995ef810d881be8d6bc0736c0d03d3b3cee32227445c44d"}}
{"chunk_id": "REL-006-chunk-000", "document_id": "REL-006", "text": "# Automation Updates\nAutomation execution logs now expose the action result and failure reason for supported actions.", "metadata": {"product": "FlowDesk", "version": "3.2", "access_level": "public", "document_id": "REL-006", "source_name": "Automation Updates", "section_heading": "Automation Updates", "last_updated": "2026-03-18", "document_type": "release_notes", "source_path": "docs\\release_notes\\automation.md", "file_name": "automation.md", "chunk_index": 0, "chunking_strategy": "fixed_overlap", "chunk_start_char": 0, "chunk_end_char": 117, "text_hash": "bfd15aa3cbc7246521b948f235e3b0b0aeda09ee948efea7c20fba543a5f4b77"}}
{"chunk_id": "REL-007-chunk-000", "document_id": "REL-007", "text": "# Export Updates\nWorkspace exports now provide a downloadable report describing skipped fields and rows that could not be exported.", "metadata": {"product": "FlowDesk", "version": "3.2", "access_level": "public", "document_id": "REL-007", "source_name": "Export Updates", "section_heading": "Export Updates", "last_updated": "2026-02-20", "document_type": "release_notes", "source_path": "docs\\release_notes\\export.md", "file_name": "export.md", "chunk_index": 0, "chunking_strategy": "fixed_overlap", "chunk_start_char": 0, "chunk_end_char": 131, "text_hash": "d71dfb96b13b5cded01cf243ac2682925c6698bdc2a6e42b31cd2f1835d1ab05"}}
{"chunk_id": "REL-008-chunk-000", "document_id": "REL-008", "text": "# Security Updates\nAdministrative sessions now require additional verification for selected high-risk actions.", "metadata": {"product": "FlowDesk", "version": "3.2", "access_level": "public", "document_id": "REL-008", "source_name": "Security Updates", "section_heading": "Security Updates", "last_updated": "2026-01-25", "document_type": "release_notes", "source_path": "docs\\release_notes\\security.md", "file_name": "security.md", "chunk_index": 0, "chunking_strategy": "fixed_overlap", "chunk_start_char": 0, "chunk_end_char": 110, "text_hash": "18fc264ea0c8cc5368546ed78bbb735165a19e2163d07f0cc35c77207e392906"}}
{"chunk_id": "REL-005-chunk-000", "document_id": "REL-005", "text": "# SSO Updates\nSSO configuration now supports additional identity-provider metadata formats. Existing configurations remain supported.", "metadata": {"product": "FlowDesk", "version": "3.2", "access_level": "public", "document_id": "REL-005", "source_name": "SSO Updates", "section_heading": "SSO Updates", "last_updated": "2026-04-12", "document_type": "release_notes", "source_path": "docs\\release_notes\\sso.md", "file_name": "sso.md", "chunk_index": 0, "chunking_strategy": "fixed_overlap", "chunk_start_char": 0, "chunk_end_char": 133, "text_hash": "399cc88e88c7d44951f3ae9af1dd284758a2c17e972737fdbcc0252370620cc0"}}
{"chunk_id": "REL-004-chunk-000", "document_id": "REL-004", "text": "# API v2 Legacy Notes\nAPI v2 used page-number pagination and did not support scoped API tokens. This document is historical and should not be used as the primary source for current API behavior.", "metadata": {"product": "FlowDesk", "version": "3.2", "access_level": "public", "document_id": "REL-004", "source_name": "Version 2 Legacy", "section_heading": "Version 2 Legacy", "last_updated": "2025-11-01", "document_type": "release_notes", "source_path": "docs\\release_notes\\v2-legacy.md", "file_name": "v2-legacy.md", "chunk_index": 0, "chunking_strategy": "fixed_overlap", "chunk_start_char": 0, "chunk_end_char": 194, "text_hash": "5f62f654cd13c7bb69be920331bcc4fed889aedd124f0d82c79b959f54a01490"}}
{"chunk_id": "REL-003-chunk-000", "document_id": "REL-003", "text": "# Release 3.0\n## API\nThe API moved to version 3 and introduced cursor-based pagination for list endpoints.", "metadata": {"product": "FlowDesk", "version": "3.2", "access_level": "public", "document_id": "REL-003", "source_name": "Version 3.0", "section_heading": "Version 3.0", "last_updated": "2026-05-20", "document_type": "release_notes", "source_path": "docs\\release_notes\\v3-0.md", "file_name": "v3-0.md", "chunk_index": 0, "chunking_strategy": "fixed_overlap", "chunk_start_char": 0, "chunk_end_char": 106, "text_hash": "3387d4af2dd8ad6fbd623c771fd3d0885c25002a44a1f71fce618a95c021eb5c"}}
{"chunk_id": "REL-002-chunk-000", "document_id": "REL-002", "text": "# Release 3.1\n## Search\nSearch gained improved exact phrase handling.\n\n## Webhooks\nWebhook delivery logs now show the response status from the destination endpoint.", "metadata": {"product": "FlowDesk", "version": "3.2", "access_level": "public", "document_id": "REL-002", "source_name": "Version 3.1", "section_heading": "Version 3.1", "last_updated": "2026-06-15", "document_type": "release_notes", "source_path": "docs\\release_notes\\v3-1.md", "file_name": "v3-1.md", "chunk_index": 0, "chunking_strategy": "fixed_overlap", "chunk_start_char": 0, "chunk_end_char": 164, "text_hash": "47616e12a782ae36a15c46bc539c9c94b81a824f68f884a87fca47da34908953"}}
{"chunk_id": "REL-001-chunk-000", "document_id": "REL-001", "text": "# Release 3.2\n## API authentication\nScoped API tokens are now supported. Existing unscoped tokens remain supported.\n\n## Rate limits\nRate-limit responses now include Retry-After when the server can provide a recommended retry delay.", "metadata": {"product": "FlowDesk", "version": "3.2", "access_level": "public", "document_id": "REL-001", "source_name": "Version 3.2", "section_heading": "Version 3.2", "last_updated": "2026-07-15", "document_type": "release_notes", "source_path": "docs\\release_notes\\v3-2.md", "file_name": "v3-2.md", "chunk_index": 0, "chunking_strategy": "fixed_overlap", "chunk_start_char": 0, "chunk_end_char": 231, "text_hash": "c26771279994203f072f90c20d4a40ee94befc1a57bc4f509e1264bdc636efdc"}}
{"chunk_id": "TRB-001-chunk-000", "document_id": "TRB-001", "text": "# Troubleshooting API 401 Errors\n## Symptoms\nAPI requests return HTTP 401.\n\n## Common causes\nA 401 response usually means the request is missing a valid authentication credential. Common causes include a missing Authorization header, an expired token, or an invalid token.\n\n## Resolution\nConfirm that the request contains a valid Bearer token and that the token belongs to the intended workspace.", "metadata": {"product": "FlowDesk", "version": "3.2", "access_level": "public", "document_id": "TRB-001", "source_name": "401 Authentication Errors", "section_heading": "401 Authentication Errors", "last_updated": "2026-07-16", "document_type": "troubleshooting", "source_path": "docs\\troubleshooting\\api-401.md", "file_name": "api-401.md", "chunk_index": 0, "chunking_strategy": "fixed_overlap", "chunk_start_char": 0, "chunk_end_char": 396, "text_hash": "a3970f21a15489fe4ee59df807ed4f67bcd49221c39f9d325612ee14ab5f9269"}}
{"chunk_id": "TRB-002-chunk-000", "document_id": "TRB-002", "text": "# Troubleshooting API 403 Errors\n## Symptoms\nThe API returns HTTP 403 even though authentication succeeds.\n\n## Cause\nThe credential may be valid but may not have permission to perform the requested operation.\n\n## Resolution\nCheck the token scope and the user's workspace permissions.", "metadata": {"product": "FlowDesk", "version": "3.2", "access_level": "public", "document_id": "TRB-002", "source_name": "403 Permission Errors", "section_heading": "403 Permission Errors", "last_updated": "2026-07-16", "document_type": "troubleshooting", "source_path": "docs\\troubleshooting\\api-403.md", "file_name": "api-403.md", "chunk_index": 0, "chunking_strategy": "fixed_overlap", "chunk_start_char": 0, "chunk_end_char": 283, "text_hash": "0ddd4b19212c6fbbc7c9a1ee208ef909e0a5012f247244b1d5d9c8661541074f"}}
{"chunk_id": "TRB-003-chunk-000", "document_id": "TRB-003", "text": "# Troubleshooting API 429 Errors\n## Symptoms\nAPI requests return HTTP 429.\n\n## Cause\nThe client has exceeded the applicable API rate limit.\n\n## Resolution\nHonor the Retry-After response when present and use exponential backoff for repeated requests.", "metadata": {"product": "FlowDesk", "version": "3.2", "access_level": "public", "document_id": "TRB-003", "source_name": "429 Rate Limit Errors", "section_heading": "429 Rate Limit Errors", "last_updated": "2026-07-17", "document_type": "troubleshooting", "source_path": "docs\\troubleshooting\\api-429.md", "file_name": "api-429.md", "chunk_index": 0, "chunking_strategy": "fixed_overlap", "chunk_start_char": 0, "chunk_end_char": 249, "text_hash": "92bf8bdbc568b05754060221c09818b5b9c49b37e22dd43b698b4f0d5b5b40b7"}}
{"chunk_id": "TRB-008-chunk-000", "document_id": "TRB-008", "text": "# Troubleshooting Automations\n## Check activation\nConfirm the automation is enabled and that its trigger conditions are satisfied.\n\n## Permissions\nSome automation actions require elevated workspace permissions.", "metadata": {"product": "FlowDesk", "version": "3.2", "access_level": "public", "document_id": "TRB-008", "source_name": "Automation Not Running", "section_heading": "Automation Not Running", "last_updated": "2026-07-14", "document_type": "troubleshooting", "source_path": "docs\\troubleshooting\\automation.md", "file_name": "automation.md", "chunk_index": 0, "chunking_strategy": "fixed_overlap", "chunk_start_char": 0, "chunk_end_char": 210, "text_hash": "6d15f3f5e92b895c90d4a4368cf66291f0382407da2c9b3b540a809ad31b4763"}}
{"chunk_id": "TRB-010-chunk-000", "document_id": "TRB-010", "text": "# Troubleshooting Exports\nIf an export is unavailable, check that the user has the required permission and that the requested object type supports export. Large exports may take time to prepare.", "metadata": {"product": "FlowDesk", "version": "3.2", "access_level": "public", "document_id": "TRB-010", "source_name": "Export Problems", "section_heading": "Export Problems", "last_updated": "2026-07-13", "document_type": "troubleshooting", "source_path": "docs\\troubleshooting\\export.md", "file_name": "export.md", "chunk_index": 0, "chunking_strategy": "fixed_overlap", "chunk_start_char": 0, "chunk_end_char": 194, "text_hash": "6de70f26db20db50ad77263664e0b44be64ba7c0924e83043bb9501f2f09160f"}}
{"chunk_id": "TRB-007-chunk-000", "document_id": "TRB-007", "text": "# Troubleshooting Imports\n## Invalid rows\nImports can fail when required fields are missing or values have an unsupported format.\n\n## Large imports\nFor large datasets, split the input into smaller batches and review the import report after each batch.", "metadata": {"product": "FlowDesk", "version": "3.2", "access_level": "public", "document_id": "TRB-007", "source_name": "Import Failures", "section_heading": "Import Failures", "last_updated": "2026-07-13", "document_type": "troubleshooting", "source_path": "docs\\troubleshooting\\import.md", "file_name": "import.md", "chunk_index": 0, "chunking_strategy": "fixed_overlap", "chunk_start_char": 0, "chunk_end_char": 251, "text_hash": "61e9c8257cfa1539b6b53cacb25e095d216122f64af4f651f190c9c14bcc8576"}}
{"chunk_id": "TRB-006-chunk-000", "document_id": "TRB-006", "text": "# Troubleshooting Invitations\n## Invite not received\nCheck the recipient address and spam folder. An administrator can resend an invitation.\n\n## Invite expired\nExpired invitations must be resent by an administrator.", "metadata": {"product": "FlowDesk", "version": "3.2", "access_level": "public", "document_id": "TRB-006", "source_name": "Invitation Problems", "section_heading": "Invitation Problems", "last_updated": "2026-07-11", "document_type": "troubleshooting", "source_path": "docs\\troubleshooting\\invite.md", "file_name": "invite.md", "chunk_index": 0, "chunking_strategy": "fixed_overlap", "chunk_start_char": 0, "chunk_end_char": 215, "text_hash": "80ef024e6ab88e1d76a7d6b9716617822a6d4028909e52e49e0060b3b88fced3"}}
{"chunk_id": "TRB-005-chunk-000", "document_id": "TRB-005", "text": "# Troubleshooting Login\n## Incorrect credentials\nConfirm the email address and password.\n\n## SSO users\nIf the workspace requires SSO, use the organization's configured identity provider.\n\n## Locked account\nRepeated unsuccessful authentication attempts can temporarily restrict access.", "metadata": {"product": "FlowDesk", "version": "3.2", "access_level": "public", "document_id": "TRB-005", "source_name": "Login Problems", "section_heading": "Login Problems", "last_updated": "2026-07-09", "document_type": "troubleshooting", "source_path": "docs\\troubleshooting\\login.md", "file_name": "login.md", "chunk_index": 0, "chunking_strategy": "fixed_overlap", "chunk_start_char": 0, "chunk_end_char": 284, "text_hash": "dbfc21a201e8406609471b29d2cfa17f723fd91c1e1988206118ad1d579a1f43"}}
{"chunk_id": "TRB-009-chunk-000", "document_id": "TRB-009", "text": "# Troubleshooting Search\nSearch performance can vary with workspace size and query complexity. Narrowing a query with a ticket ID, exact phrase, or date filter can reduce the search scope.", "metadata": {"product": "FlowDesk", "version": "3.2", "access_level": "public", "document_id": "TRB-009", "source_name": "Slow Search", "section_heading": "Slow Search", "last_updated": "2026-07-08", "document_type": "troubleshooting", "source_path": "docs\\troubleshooting\\slow-search.md", "file_name": "slow-search.md", "chunk_index": 0, "chunking_strategy": "fixed_overlap", "chunk_start_char": 0, "chunk_end_char": 188, "text_hash": "d2523f2f5680f5f6664f9daec623b15ad235ecf12d9782d94e7df3189817d255"}}
{"chunk_id": "TRB-004-chunk-000", "document_id": "TRB-004", "text": "# Troubleshooting Webhook Failures\n## Symptoms\nA configured webhook is not reaching the destination.\n\n## Checks\nVerify the endpoint URL, TLS configuration, response status, and network accessibility. FlowDesk retries some failed deliveries.\n\n## Important\nWebhook delivery is not guaranteed to be instantaneous.", "metadata": {"product": "FlowDesk", "version": "3.2", "access_level": "public", "document_id": "TRB-004", "source_name": "Webhook Delivery Failures", "section_heading": "Webhook Delivery Failures", "last_updated": "2026-07-12", "document_type": "troubleshooting", "source_path": "docs\\troubleshooting\\webhook-failures.md", "file_name": "webhook-failures.md", "chunk_index": 0, "chunking_strategy": "fixed_overlap", "chunk_start_char": 0, "chunk_end_char": 310, "text_hash": "54b23f4bae3d52dd2efdb298d7c3e4304ca8b87b6c9e930e46cd61136e7d8a6f"}}
